MAYOR OF SINGKAWANG

PROVINCE OF WEST KALIMANTAN

REGIONAL REGULATION OF SINGKAWANG CITY

NUMBER 4 OF 2017

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF CHILDREN AND WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF SINGKAWANG,

a . that girls as creations of Almighty God need to be protected and their honor, dignity, and self-esteem safeguarded from all forms of discrimination, acts of violence, and exploitation to improve the quality of life of children and women physically, spiritually, and socially in realizing an advanced, just, prosperous, well-off, and democratic society based on Pancasila and the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

b . that the fate of children and women in Singkawang City needs attention from the Regional Government and the community because cases of violence against children and women still occur, and children in conflict with the law, thus requiring efforts to provide legal protection for children and women;

Bearing in mind
c. that to provide protection for children and women, also as implementation of higher Laws and Regulations and constituting one of the mandatory governmental affairs that is the authority of the Regional Government, the regulation of protection of children and women needs to be regulated in a Regional Regulation;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on Protection of Children and Women;

